WEBVTT

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:35.430
Saint Seiya

00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:10.360
Saint Seiya

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:43.730
Athena, is anything out of the ordinary?

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:45.540
Yes.

00:03:46.050 --> 00:03:51.000
I felt an intruder's Cosmo.

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:54.000
Thank you, but your concern is unnecessary.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:58.640
However, Hades' forces are advancing.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.000
You need to be careful.

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:06.260
Miro, those visitors were not enemies.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:12.020
On the contrary, they are strong
allies who offered their support.

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:17.150
I have no idea who they could be.

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:18.910
They are...

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:23.310
That...

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:29.500
Transient Meeting

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:32.500
What did you say? That man?

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:35.660
He was alive?

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.970
He is currently guarding the Gemini house.

00:04:45.000 --> 00:04:46.540
The Gemini house.

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:12.030
I can't believe that man was alive.

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:13.500
That man?

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:15.690
Moreover.

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:20.030
He stands before me once again.

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:25.410
You know the man who wears your Gemini Cloth?

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:31.740
He's the man who whispered
the devil's call in my ear.

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:39.630
Now, leave this to me and go ahead.

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:43.830
All right. The Gemini palace
was originally yours to guard.

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:46.700
It won't hurt for you to take some time.

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:47.870
Hurry.

00:05:47.900 --> 00:05:48.830
All right, let's go.

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:50.760
We're going ahead, Saga.

00:06:02.010 --> 00:06:03.710
Thirteen years ago.

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:11.910
From the prison in Sunion
Cape, impenetrable by man,

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:14.010
you went missing.

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:17.470
I thought you were struck
down by the wrath of God.

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:21.570
You are the one who received
God's wrath, Saga.

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:22.440
What?

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:25.040
You failed to kill Athena
and take the Sanctuary,

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:28.570
only to be punished by God.

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:31.020
You chose death.

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:34.900
And now you've become Hades' bloodhound.

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:39.570
You stand with the Specters
to take Athena's life.

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:44.760
Saga, so you were indeed evil, after all.

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:49.730
Shut up. You are the one
who planted the evil in me.

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:56.000
You are the one who held a grudge
against Athena and I to the grave.

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:01.120
So why are you wearing the Gemini Gold Cloth,

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:03.640
guarding the Gemini house?

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:05.860
Take off the mask and answer me!

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:16.580
Eastern Siberia

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:21.360
Mama.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:24.670
I haven't been able to see you

00:07:25.040 --> 00:07:29.840
since your ship sank into the deep abyss.

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:31.820
Are you not lonely?

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:39.030
I have the strength to dive
into the deepest abyss.

00:07:40.300 --> 00:07:44.920
But I vowed never to go see Mama again.

00:07:45.890 --> 00:07:51.370
Nevertheless, I can never forget about Mama.

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:54.950
Camus, one of my masters

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:57.400
who has guided my soul with compassion.

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:03.720
I ask you again,

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:06.590
why do you want to become a Saint?

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:08.570
For Mama.

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:13.050
To pull out Mama with my own strength.

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:14.720
You'll die.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:15.390
What?

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:20.770
With that kind of immaturity, you'll
die even if you become a Saint.

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:22.610
Look, Hyoga.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:29.010
The eternal ice wall hasn't melted
in tens of thousands of years.

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:33.320
Hyoga, if you aim to become a Saint,

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:35.970
be strong like the ice wall.

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:41.930
The strength to exist without
melting under the sun.

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:46.500
Listen, Hyoga.

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:52.240
Learn true strength from the
permanent ice of Siberia.

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:04.830
Mama and my teacher, my friend.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:12.260
I will pray for the happiness
of these irreplaceable people.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:14.670
As long as I'm alive,

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:18.350
I will continue to do so
in this East Siberian land.

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:26.520
Again, I sense a Cosmo going off
in the direction of the Sanctuary.

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:29.370
What is going on in the Sanctuary?

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:31.830
That's not for you to know.

00:09:37.980 --> 00:09:39.980
Hyoga, it's been a while.

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:43.730
I've been resurrected
from hell to defeat you.

00:09:48.380 --> 00:09:50.550
No way.

00:09:58.710 --> 00:10:02.250
Who granted you permission to be here?

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:05.120
Athena, of course.

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:10.680
Athena would never grant one possessed
by evil like you permission.

00:10:11.550 --> 00:10:13.370
Listen, Saga.

00:10:23.860 --> 00:10:26.350
In the prison, on Sunion Cape...

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:29.800
My life has been saved
by Athena numerous times.

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:33.180
Even in the Temple under the sea,

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:37.660
I saw unconditional love
in her engulfing Cosmo.

00:10:41.340 --> 00:10:47.070
Athena cleansed my heart of evil.

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:54.400
From now, I fight only
for Athena and justice.

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:59.500
Any evil, from this Gemini house and beyond,

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:03.340
will not be allowed to pass, so be prepared.

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.870
Not allowed to pass?

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:09.490
Camus and Shura have both passed by.

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:10.570
Really?

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:11.190
What?

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:16.270
The Gemini house can transform into a maze

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:18.880
by the power of the guardian.

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:21.410
What? Could you have?

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:26.930
Camus and Shura will never
leave the Gemini house.

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:31.540
They've both stumbled into the
Gemini labyrinth I've constructed.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:34.330
They're wandering desperately.

00:11:35.990 --> 00:11:40.000
I understand why you are
trying to protect this place.

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:44.350
But to side with Athena as the Gemini Saint

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:46.850
at this point is too late.

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:53.170
Your heart is permanently tainted with evil.

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:57.500
I know best.

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:04.030
I will expose you.

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:07.400
If I defeat you, the maze
will also disappear.

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:09.730
Two birds with one stone.

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:12.350
First, I'll rip off that mask

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:14.660
and look evil in the face for
the first time in 13 years.

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:15.330
Take this!

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:31.680
Fool, such trickery won't work!

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:36.350
What?

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:44.660
What is this?

00:12:45.350 --> 00:12:48.700
I see, this is also an
illusion. That means...

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:54.660
I get it. How far will you mimic me?

00:12:55.480 --> 00:13:01.310
But your mimicry won't work on me!

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:08.170
Wherever you are, I will get you!

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:29.750
Please wait here.

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:44.630
From the Gemini house below,
it's such a distance.

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:48.410
To send such a force, that man.

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:55.780
Saga, I didn't want to believe it,
but the Cosmo I felt is yours.

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:02.180
And...

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:08.920
The one who came to receive Athena's
permission to fight as Saint.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:11.930
Saga's brother, Canon.

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:21.920
Saga, who has been called
the incarnation of God,

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:25.800
is not one to fall for Gemini's illusions.

00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:30.990
Fortunately, there's been little
damage. So get out of here!

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:33.990
Even if Athena permits you,

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:37.910
do you think we Gold Saints will trust you?

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:41.760
Immediately disappear from the Sanctuary.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:44.150
That...

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:48.870
If you remain, I will get rid of you, Canon.

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:54.090
Unfortunately, I cannot
leave. I will fight here.

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:57.010
Then your first opponent is me.

00:14:57.140 --> 00:15:02.840
I can't live being related to a traitor,
so I will take you down by force!

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:07.800
Saga and the Specters are advancing,
we have no time to waste.

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:16.400
Will you not leave this place, Canon?

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:17.340
No.

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:20.210
I've come to protect Athena.

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:21.440
Don't make me laugh!

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:27.440
You, who manipulated Poseidon to hurt
Athena and the innocent populous.

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:28.860
No one will acknowledge you!

00:15:32.230 --> 00:15:36.370
I will say one more time. Leave
if you do not wish to die.

00:15:36.610 --> 00:15:42.380
Enough. I can't leave until I take
care of the advancing Specters.

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:45.670
Then take this! The deep red shock!

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.420
Scarlet Needle!

00:15:54.360 --> 00:16:00.540
The external damage of the Scarlet
Needle is as small as a needle hole.

00:16:00.720 --> 00:16:03.770
But in reality the pain
is beyond imagination.

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:09.670
It's the shock of a scorpion's
poison coursing through your body.

00:16:17.570 --> 00:16:22.090
There are only two things awaiting
the victim of the Scarlet Needle.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:26.600
A spiritual death or a physical death.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:33.900
Answer before all 15 stars of
Scorpio punctures your body.

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:42.280
Canon, which will it be?
The collapse of your mind?

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:43.650
Or the destruction of your body?

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:02.950
Odd. Why doesn't this man attack me?

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:07.120
It's as if he gladly
accepts my Scarlet Needle.

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:12.660
I can sense from Canon's Cosmo

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:16.860
the same awesome power of his brother, Saga.

00:17:17.420 --> 00:17:19.770
If he fought to his fullest
ability, it'd be an even match.

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:27.030
I could possibly even lose. So why?

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:35.940
Could it be? Could it be, this man?

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:43.760
You are Specters?

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:48.500
In the name of Lord Hades,
we'll have you die here.

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:53.050
We'll let you sleep in the cold,
dark abyss with your Mama.

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:56.690
We can wait until you put on your Cloth.

00:17:56.850 --> 00:18:00.070
Well, even if he puts on the Bronze Cloth,

00:18:00.070 --> 00:18:01.790
he's no worthy opponent.

00:18:02.250 --> 00:18:06.130
Who's the one who got beat
by that Bronze nobody?

00:18:06.130 --> 00:18:06.640
What?

00:18:07.460 --> 00:18:10.330
You have betrayed Athena for evil.

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:14.860
The Cosmo you have pledged
to Hades is tainted.

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:20.490
Tainted Cosmo in a bunch are
no worthy opponent for me.

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:22.000
Gibberish!

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:42.770
Die!

00:18:42.920 --> 00:18:46.980
Aurora Thunder Attack!

00:18:58.290 --> 00:19:00.140
You've become strong, Hyoga.

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:02.530
We can leave Athena in your hands.

00:19:03.310 --> 00:19:04.920
You guys.

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:12.720
I must hurry to the Sanctuary.

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:22.460
Miro, what's wrong? Continue!

00:19:22.940 --> 00:19:28.640
Even if I'm punctured by all 15 hits
of the Scarlet Needles, I will bear it.

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:34.420
Because I am not allowed to die.

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:36.780
Why?

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:40.860
This flesh that has been granted by Athena.

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:45.610
I cannot die without defeating one enemy.

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:51.080
Now, Miro. Show me no mercy. Now!

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:56.130
This man, for all his past sins.

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:58.440
To amend his sins.

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:02.960
Is allowing the Scarlet
Needle to puncture his body?

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:05.390
Fine.

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:07.900
How much can he endure?

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:12.480
Take all 15 hits to your body, Canon!

00:20:21.020 --> 00:20:21.940
Miro!

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:25.620
Athena, you must not go out.

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:27.530
It's dangerous.

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:30.580
Miro, what are you doing?

00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:36.870
I told you Canon is here to
help us to atone his past sins.

00:20:37.290 --> 00:20:41.800
Even you should be able to tell if
Canon is evil or not by looking at him.

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:43.550
Yes, but Athena,

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:49.270
even if you forgive him,
I, Aioria, Shaka and Mu.

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:56.400
No, all the surviving Saints
will never acknowledge Canon.

00:20:56.920 --> 00:20:57.810
Miro.

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:02.320
That much blood has been shed in his name.

00:21:02.720 --> 00:21:06.400
Just because he is reformed
doesn't mean he can be trusted.

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:10.390
If Canon were to repent for his sins,

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:13.640
he would need to take his own life.

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:14.500
Well...

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:17.380
Athena, it's fine.

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:22.550
Now, stand up, Canon.
Take the last three hits.

00:21:23.280 --> 00:21:24.550
Come, Miro!

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:34.270
Canon!

00:21:38.800 --> 00:21:40.950
You've finally coughed up blood.

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:42.940
Along with the blood loss,

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:45.810
you will lose your consciousness
and five senses.

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:51.680
But to die with honor, you must
take the final hit on your body.

00:21:52.050 --> 00:21:54.460
The finishing Antares!

00:21:55.350 --> 00:22:00.370
To whomever withstands until this
point, the Antares rewards with death.

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:07.430
That's right, Canon, this will
end everything. Everything.

00:22:08.530 --> 00:22:11.230
Miro, you are...

00:22:12.420 --> 00:22:14.170
Now, here I come!

00:22:14.490 --> 00:22:17.260
Scarlet Needles greatest blow!

00:22:17.470 --> 00:22:18.720
Antares!

00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:48.290
Athena, I feel the Specters Cosmo nearing.

00:22:48.420 --> 00:22:50.750
I will return to my Scorpio house.

00:22:50.750 --> 00:22:51.490
Excuse me.

00:22:52.660 --> 00:22:54.050
Wait, Miro.

00:22:54.460 --> 00:22:59.520
Are you not worried leaving
Athena along with me, the enemy?

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:04.170
The enemy is no longer here.

00:23:04.770 --> 00:23:06.960
Only my comrade.

00:23:06.970 --> 00:23:07.600
Huh?

00:23:08.090 --> 00:23:12.700
His name is Gold Saint Gemini Canon.

00:23:15.750 --> 00:23:16.520
Miro.

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:26.740
Athena.

00:23:27.750 --> 00:23:28.480
Yes.

00:23:29.250 --> 00:23:33.240
Miro didn't unleash the
Antares for his final blow.

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:37.540
He hit my vital point to stop the bleeding.

00:23:38.160 --> 00:23:42.560
Miro has acknowledged me as a true Saint.

00:23:43.110 --> 00:23:47.800
His Scarlet Needle was his form of pardon.

00:23:49.100 --> 00:23:52.700
Yes, I could tell by watching you two.

00:23:52.850 --> 00:23:56.590
Miro's feelings and Canon, your feelings.

00:24:00.520 --> 00:24:04.170
People can redeem themselves.

00:24:05.260 --> 00:24:09.080
But, Canon, in this battle of Hades,

00:24:09.180 --> 00:24:11.910
both you and I will probably die.

00:24:12.690 --> 00:24:17.450
In other words, we just extended
our lives by a little bit.

00:24:23.910 --> 00:24:25.240
We've cleared the Gemini house.

00:24:25.660 --> 00:24:28.600
Camus, what was that?

00:24:28.800 --> 00:24:31.670
It was like we were running in circles.

00:24:31.790 --> 00:24:36.450
Right. We must have wandered into
Gemini's notorious labyrinth.

00:24:36.660 --> 00:24:39.550
The fact that the illusion vanished

00:24:39.550 --> 00:24:42.580
and we were able to exit must mean...

00:24:43.020 --> 00:24:43.670
Saga.

00:24:44.300 --> 00:24:48.150
Did you take care of the mystery
man guarding the Gemini house?

00:24:48.290 --> 00:24:52.630
No, I hit him once and
avoided this situation.

00:24:53.030 --> 00:24:55.630
He doesn't seem to be an ordinary man.

00:24:55.750 --> 00:24:56.620
Who is he?

00:24:56.900 --> 00:24:57.520
Mmm.

00:24:58.560 --> 00:25:01.980
He, my brother, Canon,

00:25:02.040 --> 00:25:05.460
tried to guard the Gemini in my place.

00:25:06.190 --> 00:25:10.100
I wouldn't have dreamed it.

00:25:12.320 --> 00:25:12.900
Saga.

00:25:13.180 --> 00:25:14.310
It's nothing.

00:25:14.540 --> 00:25:16.990
Next is the fourth Cancer house. Let's hurry!

00:25:19.680 --> 00:25:26.420
Canon, whether you really abandoned
evil and woken up to justice,

00:25:27.290 --> 00:25:29.630
we'll see if it's true.

00:25:30.030 --> 00:25:34.130
You will have to prove
yourself with your actions.

00:26:47.670 --> 00:26:50.970
Saint Seiya

00:26:52.170 --> 00:26:54.740
Saga, Camus, and Shura, now minions of Hades,

00:26:54.740 --> 00:26:56.930
defeat the guardians of the 12 houses one by one.

00:26:56.930 --> 00:26:59.820
Is this an omen of the end of the Saints' legend?

00:26:59.820 --> 00:27:01.430
No! We're still here!

00:27:01.430 --> 00:27:03.850
Shiryu, Hyoga, Shun, and Ikki...

00:27:03.850 --> 00:27:08.310
So long as our Cosmo burns, the legend of the Saints will live forever!

00:27:08.690 --> 00:27:12.470
Saint Seiya, "Transient Meeting" and "The Warrior from Ancient Times."

00:27:12.470 --> 00:27:15.280
Do you sense the Cosmo?
